{"seq":2,"slug":"exile-and-enlightenment","title":"Exile And Enlightenment","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/exile-and-enlightenment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-liuzhou-affair","title":"触怒权阉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/exile-and-enlightenment/the-liuzhou-affair","wordCount":1433,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"enlightenment-at-longchang","title":"龙场悟道","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/life-and-times/exile-and-enlightenment/enlightenment-at-longchang","wordCount":1479,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现王阳明一生最重要的转折——贬谪与悟道。他因仗义执言、触怒权阉刘瑾，遭廷杖、被贬谪到偏远的贵州龙场。然而，正是在龙场困厄的绝境中，王阳明直面生死、苦苦参究，终于豁然大悟&quot;圣人之道，吾性自足&quot;，确立了&quot;心即理&quot;，开创了心学。本章揭示这场&quot;困而后得&quot;的伟大转折——龙场悟道，心学诞生的起点。</p>\n"}